{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c43806c-db0e-11ef-96f0-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c438061-db0e-11ef-b1a0-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雕陰郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b39e4a51-db0e-11ef-9b2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b39e4a52-db0e-11ef-af26-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b39e4a53-db0e-11ef-8c61-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：雕陰郡，西魏置綏州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：雕阴郡，西魏置绥州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b39e4a50-db0e-11ef-9bdf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"上县•陕西绥德","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b39e4a5a-db0e-11ef-98f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"此其故址云]。","context_before":"...。相传扶苏所筑。又古长城，在州西十五里，亦秦魏时分界处。","source_end_index":145,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e3267b6b-26a4-59cd-9562-98b6f496979f","source_start_index":92,"source_text":"《志》云：州北又有长城，隋置。《隋书》：开皇三年，遣崔仲方于朔方灵武筑长城，东距河，西至绥州，绵历七百里。"},{"context_after":"。","context_before":"凤凰岭[在州东三十里。又州东南有勃出岭。","source_end_index":82,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a1841019-b801-52eb-89f0-84831eef2501","source_start_index":20,"source_text":"《唐书》：武德初，崔仲方奉命于朔方郡筑长城，东至黄河，西距绥州，南抵勃出岭，绵历七百余里以备边。又开渠溉田，民获其利甚溥云]"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"18隋主使司農少卿崔仲方發丁三萬，於朔方、靈武築長城，東距河，西至綏州，綿歷七百里，以遏胡寇。","content_fanyi":"隋文帝命司农少卿崔仲方征发民夫三万人，在朔方、灵武一带修筑长城，东起黄河，西至绥州，绵延七百里，用来阻挡北方胡人入侵。","content_jianti_auto":"18隋主使司农少卿崔仲方发丁三万，于朔方、灵武筑长城，东距河，西至绥州，绵历七百里，以遏胡寇。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，东巡泰岳，作仁寿宫，而丁夫死者万计，别宫十二，相因营造...","context_before":"...乱哉？故不十年而盗贼竞起以亡隋。民之不辑也久矣，考其时，","source_end_index":306,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"df12381e-2bb4-4c16-bc13-031a100fa5d2","source_start_index":302,"source_text":"北筑长城"}],"title":"一一 隋均田乃虐民之政"}],"id":17064,"number":18,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十六 (陳紀十) / 長城公下 / 三年 / 第 26 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b39e4a4f-db0e-11ef-9a05-a0d3651f611f","year_int":585},"tongjian_id":"b39e4a4f-db0e-11ef-9a05-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孫愐","people_name_jianti_auto":"孙愐","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a1-db0e-11ef-abb9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a2-db0e-11ef-93ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雕陰郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a3-db0e-11ef-a608-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雕陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"雕阴","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a4-db0e-11ef-9f29-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a5-db0e-11ef-8852-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上郡","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a6-db0e-11ef-9ac4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"延州","place_name_jianti_auto":"延州","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a7-db0e-11ef-bed0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"橫山","place_name_jianti_auto":"横山","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a8-db0e-11ef-8cc4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0a9-db0e-11ef-8c3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0aa-db0e-11ef-afbc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白狄","place_name_jianti_auto":"白狄","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0ab-db0e-11ef-9c74-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0ac-db0e-11ef-a293-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上郡","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0ad-db0e-11ef-a320-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0ae-db0e-11ef-9b96-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上州","place_name_jianti_auto":"上州","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0af-db0e-11ef-8c9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0b0-db0e-11ef-8c9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏德縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥德县","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0b1-db0e-11ef-bedd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"綏州，雕陰郡。雕陰古縣，漢屬上郡，今延州以北橫山之地也。孫愐曰：綏州，春秋時爲白狄所居，秦爲上郡，後魏置上州，又改爲綏州，取綏德縣爲名。","note_content_jianti_auto":"绥州，雕阴郡。雕阴古县，汉属上郡，今延州以北横山之地也。孙愐曰：绥州，春秋时为白狄所居，秦为上郡，后魏置上州，又改为绥州，取绥德县为名。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b7c24b9c-db0e-11ef-a991-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b7c2d0b6-db0e-11ef-af90-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"20壬申，突厥寇忻州，丙子，寇幷州；京師戒嚴。戊寅，寇綏州，刺史劉大俱擊卻之。","content_fanyi":"初五日壬申，突厥侵犯忻州。初九日丙子，突厥侵犯并州；京城因此戒严。十一日戊寅，突厥侵犯绥州，绥州刺史刘大俱将突厥军队击退。","content_jianti_auto":"20壬申，突厥寇忻州，丙子，寇幷州；京师戒严。戊寅，寇绥州，刺史刘大俱击却之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18510,"number":20,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九十一 (唐紀七) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝下之上 / 武德七年 / 第 27 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b7c24b9b-db0e-11ef-b301-a0d3651f611f","year_int":624},"tongjian_id":"b7c24b9b-db0e-11ef-b301-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b7c435c7-db0e-11ef-b950-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"22癸卯，突厥寇綏州，都督劉大俱擊破之，獲特勒三人。","content_fanyi":"九月初六日癸卯，突厥侵犯绥州，绥州都督刘大俱将其击败，俘获三名特勒。","content_jianti_auto":"22癸卯，突厥寇绥州，都督刘大俱击破之，获特勒三人。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18516,"number":22,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九十一 (唐紀七) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝下之上 / 武德七年 / 第 33 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b7c435c4-db0e-11ef-90b6-a0d3651f611f","year_int":624},"tongjian_id":"b7c435c4-db0e-11ef-90b6-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"頡，奚結翻。可，從刊入聲。汗，音寒。將，卽亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"颉，奚结翻。可，从刊入声。汗，音寒。将，即亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c0-db0e-11ef-8f8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"中書侍郞，機近在官。","note_content_jianti_auto":"中书侍郞，机近在官。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c2-db0e-11ef-a446-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"廣武","place_name_jianti_auto":"广武","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c4-db0e-11ef-863f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣武","place_name_jianti_auto":"广武","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c5-db0e-11ef-b52e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈州","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵州","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c6-db0e-11ef-817f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"代州","place_name_jianti_auto":"代州","place_note":"总部设山西省代县","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c7-db0e-11ef-9b52-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鴈門","place_name_jianti_auto":"鴈门","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c8-db0e-11ef-bbee-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c9-db0e-11ef-ac89-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣武縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"广武县","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b7c935ca-db0e-11ef-98c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣武","place_name_jianti_auto":"广武","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"b7c935cb-db0e-11ef-ac9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太谷","place_name_jianti_auto":"太谷","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"b7c935cc-db0e-11ef-aa3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"b7c935cd-db0e-11ef-a9fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鴈門","place_name_jianti_auto":"鴈门","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"b7c935ce-db0e-11ef-b53e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣武","place_name_jianti_auto":"广武","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"b7c935cf-db0e-11ef-b22e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：實錄、統紀並云寇廣武。按北邊地名無廣武；下云靈州都督敗之，蓋「靈武」字誤耳。今按舊唐志，代州鴈門，漢廣武縣。或者寇廣武卽太谷乘勝之兵歟？史臣以漢古縣名稱鴈門爲廣武耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：实录、统纪并云寇广武。按北边地名无广武；下云灵州都督败之，盖「灵武」字误耳。今按旧唐志，代州鴈门，汉广武县。或者寇广武即太谷乘胜之兵欤？史臣以汉古县名称鴈门为广武耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"b7c935c3-db0e-11ef-ade5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"道宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"道宗","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b7c935d5-db0e-11ef-9a72-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"靈州","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵州","place_note":"宁夏灵武市","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b7c935d6-db0e-11ef-93eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"道宗所破者，癸亥寇靈州之兵，詳見通鑑舉要。","note_content_jianti_auto":"道宗所破者，癸亥寇灵州之兵，详见通鉴举要。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"b7c935d4-db0e-11ef-b73a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b7c935be-db0e-11ef-8cc6-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"guī","source_anchor_text":"軍總管任瓌屯太行以","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":20,"text":"瓌","tongjian_id":"0a360fa3-2f89-546b-9f0a-412b0815721d"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"侨州•陕西省子长县东","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"b7c9846b-db0e-11ef-8dd0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"即今县矣。又县西北十五里有洛漠城，即《水经注》所云涂水出...","context_before":"...东南十五里。汉县治此。后周建德四年，始移今治。隋曰太谷。","source_end_index":70,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dd9dd0ef-7efc-55f9-af91-2e3b6eef6d9f","source_start_index":34,"source_text":"唐武德八年，李高迁屯太谷以拒突厥，既而并州总管张瑾与突厥战于太谷，军没。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宝应初，以史朝义据洛阳，征回纥兵至河东。药子昂往劳军，请...","context_before":"...德三年，世民攻王世充于东都，分遣将刘德威自太行东围河内。","source_end_index":1395,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"31e1dbf3-0a1f-55fc-9d65-9ce6569577da","source_start_index":1372,"source_text":"八年，突厥寇并州，诏总管任瑰屯太行，以备突厥。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"17詔安州大都督李靖出潞州道，行軍總管任瓌屯太行，以禦突厥。頡利可汗將兵十餘萬大掠朔州。壬申，幷州道行軍總管張瑾與突厥戰于太谷，全軍皆沒，瑾脫身奔李靖。行軍長史溫彥博爲虜所執，虜以彥博職在機近，問以國家兵糧虛實，彥博不對，虜遷之陰山。庚辰，突厥寇靈武，甲申，靈州都督任城王道宗擊破之。丙戌，突厥寇綏州。丁亥，頡利可汗遣使請和而退。","content_fanyi":"唐高祖下诏，命安州大都督李靖从潞州道出兵，行军总管任瓌屯驻太行山，以抵御突厥。突厥颉利可汗亲自率领十多万军队，大举抢掠朔州。八月十一日壬申，并州道行军总管张瑾与突厥在太谷交战，全军覆没，张瑾脱身投奔李靖。行军长史温彦博被突厥俘获，突厥认为他在唐朝廷中担任接近皇帝的机要官职，便向他查问国家兵力和粮食储备的虚实，温彦博拒不回答，突厥把他流放到阴山。十九日庚辰，突厥侵犯灵武，二十三日甲申，灵州都督任城王李道宗击败突厥。二十五日丙戌，突厥侵犯绥州。二十六日丁亥，突厥颉利可汗派遣使者请求讲和，随后撤退。","content_jianti_auto":"17诏安州大都督李靖出潞州道，行军总管任瓌屯太行，以御突厥。颉利可汗将兵十余万大掠朔州。壬申，幷州道行军总管张瑾与突厥战于太谷，全军皆没，瑾脱身奔李靖。行军长史温彦博为虏所执，虏以彦博职在机近，问以国家兵粮虚实，彦博不对，虏迁之阴山。庚辰，突厥寇灵武，甲申，灵州都督任城王道宗击破之。丙戌，突厥寇绥州。丁亥，颉利可汗遣使请和而退。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18540,"number":17,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九十一 (唐紀七) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝下之上 / 八年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b7c935be-db0e-11ef-8cc6-a0d3651f611f","year_int":625},"tongjian_id":"b7c935be-db0e-11ef-8cc6-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"步落稽","place_name_jianti_auto":"步落稽","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ba009c20-db0e-11ef-aa49-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"稽胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"稽胡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"ba009c21-db0e-11ef-852f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"步落稽，稽胡也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"步落稽，稽胡也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ba009c1f-db0e-11ef-abf2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"ba009c25-db0e-11ef-8310-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"歐陽修","people_name_jianti_auto":"欧阳修","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"ba009c26-db0e-11ef-ba02-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"城平","place_name_jianti_auto":"城平","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ba009c27-db0e-11ef-a117-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"ba009c28-db0e-11ef-9c0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"ba009c29-db0e-11ef-b12d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"ba009c2a-db0e-11ef-ab40-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"膚施縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"肤施县","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"ba009c2b-db0e-11ef-bb15-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"ba009c2c-db0e-11ef-82f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"城中縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"城中县","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"ba009c2d-db0e-11ef-9ddc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"ba009c2e-db0e-11ef-8320-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"城平","place_name_jianti_auto":"城平","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"ba009c2f-db0e-11ef-a4b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大斌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"大斌县","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"ba009c30-db0e-11ef-a639-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"城平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"城平县","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"ba009c31-db0e-11ef-9b3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏平","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏平","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"ba009c32-db0e-11ef-a260-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏德縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥德县","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"ba009c33-db0e-11ef-9123-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"膚施","place_name_jianti_auto":"肤施","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"ba009c34-db0e-11ef-9b29-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"ba009c35-db0e-11ef-a1fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上郡","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"ba009c36-db0e-11ef-b04e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"丘尼谷","place_name_jianti_auto":"丘尼谷","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"ba009c37-db0e-11ef-bf24-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大斌","place_name_jianti_auto":"大斌","place_note":"陕西子洲县","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"ba009c38-db0e-11ef-8f93-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"稽胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"稽胡","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"ba009c39-db0e-11ef-8741-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"城平及二縣，皆屬綏州，西魏所置也。宋白曰：二縣皆漢膚施縣地，魏神龜元年，置城中縣，隋避諱，改爲城平。大斌縣，時理城平縣界魏平故城。綏德縣，亦膚施地，魏大統十二年，分上郡南界丘尼谷置縣。歐陽修曰：大斌者，取稽胡懷化，文武雜半以爲名。","note_content_jianti_auto":"城平及二县，皆属绥州，西魏所置也。宋白曰：二县皆汉肤施县地，魏神龟元年，置城中县，隋避讳，改为城平。大斌县，时理城平县界魏平故城。绥德县，亦肤施地，魏大统十二年，分上郡南界丘尼谷置县。欧阳修曰：大斌者，取稽胡怀化，文武杂半以为名。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"ba009c24-db0e-11ef-8841-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"月光王","people_name_jianti_auto":"月光王","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ba009c3b-db0e-11ef-98db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"務挺","people_name_jianti_auto":"务挺","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"ba009c3c-db0e-11ef-b8ac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"延州","place_name_jianti_auto":"延州","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"ba009c3d-db0e-11ef-8002-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"稽胡","place_name_jianti_auto":"稽胡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ba009c3e-db0e-11ef-9600-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：僉載云「延州稽胡」，又云「自號月光王」，又云「儀鳳中務挺斬平之」，蓋誤也。今從實錄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：佥载云「延州稽胡」，又云「自号月光王」，又云「仪凤中务挺斩平之」，盖误也。今从实录。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":180,"tongjian_id":"ba009c3a-db0e-11ef-9354-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西绥德","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"ba009c43-db0e-11ef-9c9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"唐末废。又朔方、和政二县，俱在州西南。后魏置，属朔方郡。...","context_before":"...武德七年，侨置于魏平城中。贞观二年，复还旧治，仍属绥州。","source_end_index":335,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"48e15616-2745-5f06-8980-7a46a4465ae2","source_start_index":300,"source_text":"永淳二年，稽胡白铁余叛，据城平，进攻绥德、大斌二县。发兵讨平之，是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"6綏州步落稽白鐵余，埋銅佛於地中，久之，草生其上，紿其鄕人曰：「吾於此數見佛光。」擇日集衆掘地，果得之，因曰：「得見聖佛者，百疾皆愈。」遠近赴之。鐵余以雜色囊盛之數十重，得厚施，乃去一囊。數年間，歸信者衆，遂謀作亂。據城平縣，自稱光明聖皇帝，置百官，進攻綏德、大斌二縣，殺官吏，焚民居。遣右武衞將軍程務挺與夏州都督王方翼討之，甲申，攻拔其城，擒鐵余，餘黨悉平。","content_fanyi":"绥州步落稽人白铁余把铜佛埋在地下，过了很久，上面长出了草。他哄骗同乡人说：“我在这里多次看到佛光。”便择日聚集众人掘地，果然挖出了铜佛，于是说：“能见到圣佛的人，百病都会痊愈。”远近之人纷纷赶来。白铁余用杂色袋子把铜佛装起来，包了几十层，等到获得丰厚的布施，才去掉一层袋子。数年间，归附信从的人很多，他就密谋作乱。白铁余占据城平县，自称光明圣皇帝，设置百官，进攻绥德、大斌二县，杀害官吏，焚烧民居。朝廷派遣右武卫将军程务挺和夏州都督王方翼前往讨伐，甲申日攻下该城，擒获白铁余，其余党羽全部平定。","content_jianti_auto":"6绥州步落稽白铁余，埋铜佛于地中，久之，草生其上，绐其鄕人曰：「吾于此数见佛光。」择日集众掘地，果得之，因曰：「得见圣佛者，百疾皆愈。」远近赴之。铁余以杂色囊盛之数十重，得厚施，乃去一囊。数年间，归信者众，遂谋作乱。据城平县，自称光明圣皇帝，置百官，进攻绥德、大斌二县，杀官吏，焚民居。遣右武衞将军程务挺与夏州都督王方翼讨之，甲申，攻拔其城，擒铁余，余党悉平。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20033,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百三 (唐紀十九) / 高宗天皇大聖大弘孝皇帝下 / 弘道元年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ba009c1e-db0e-11ef-9d06-a0d3651f611f","year_int":683},"tongjian_id":"ba009c1e-db0e-11ef-9d06-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"河北省赵县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf547-db0e-11ef-a460-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf548-db0e-11ef-9ee7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf549-db0e-11ef-9832-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"舊志：趙州至京師東北一千八百四十二里，東都一千三十三里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"旧志：赵州至京师东北一千八百四十二里，东都一千三十三里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf546-db0e-11ef-beac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：舊紀、傳，新紀、表、傳，皆作「鄜州」，統紀作「瀛州」。實錄、唐曆作「麟州」，今從之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：旧纪、传，新纪、表、传，皆作「鄜州」，统纪作「瀛州」。实录、唐历作「麟州」，今从之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf54b-db0e-11ef-a10c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"麟州","place_name_jianti_auto":"麟州","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf556-db0e-11ef-b657-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf557-db0e-11ef-aa0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"松州都督府","place_name_jianti_auto":"松州都督府","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf558-db0e-11ef-a980-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"溱州","place_name_jianti_auto":"溱州","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf559-db0e-11ef-ac54-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"黔州都督府","place_name_jianti_auto":"黔州都督府","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55a-db0e-11ef-b650-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"溱州","place_name_jianti_auto":"溱州","place_note":"重庆市綦江县东南","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55b-db0e-11ef-8209-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55c-db0e-11ef-b62d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55d-db0e-11ef-834a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"貞觀五年置麟州以處生羌，屬松州都督府；十六年開山洞置溱州，屬黔州都督府。舊志：溱州至京師三千四百八十里，東都四千二百里。溱，側詵翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贞观五年置麟州以处生羌，属松州都督府；十六年开山洞置溱州，属黔州都督府。旧志：溱州至京师三千四百八十里，东都四千二百里。溱，侧诜翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf555-db0e-11ef-865e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"集州","place_name_jianti_auto":"集州","place_note":"四川省南江县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf560-db0e-11ef-8479-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf561-db0e-11ef-a6cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf562-db0e-11ef-bd4b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西省绥德县","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf563-db0e-11ef-9ffe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf564-db0e-11ef-8b43-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf565-db0e-11ef-9574-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"舊志：集州，京師西南一千四百二十五里，至東都二千六百里。綏州，京師東北一千里，至東都一千八百一十九里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"旧志：集州，京师西南一千四百二十五里，至东都二千六百里。绥州，京师东北一千里，至东都一千八百一十九里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55f-db0e-11ef-8366-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西省绥德县","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf578-db0e-11ef-b754-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2周允元與司刑少卿皇甫文備奏內史豆盧欽望、同平章事韋巨源、杜景儉、蘇味道、陸元方附會李昭德，不能匡正，欽望貶趙州，巨源貶麟州，景儉貶溱州，味道貶集州，元方貶綏州刺史。","content_fanyi":"周允元和司刑少卿皇甫文备上疏弹劾内史豆卢钦望、同平章事韦巨源、杜景俭、苏味道、陆元方依附李昭德，没有尽到匡正补救的职责，豆卢钦望降职为赵州刺史，韦巨源降职为麟州刺史，杜景俭降职为溱州刺史，苏味道降职为集州刺史，陆元方降职为绥州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"2周允元与司刑少卿皇甫文备奏内史豆卢钦望、同平章事韦巨源、杜景俭、苏味道、陆元方附会李昭德，不能匡正，钦望贬赵州，巨源贬麟州，景俭贬溱州，味道贬集州，元方贬绥州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20361,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五 (唐紀二十一) / 則天順聖皇后中之上 / 天冊萬歲元年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf545-db0e-11ef-8af3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":695},"tongjian_id":"ba6cf545-db0e-11ef-8af3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"青剛嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"青刚岭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bc8d90f3-db0e-11ef-95bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"慶州","place_name_jianti_auto":"庆州","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bc8d90f4-db0e-11ef-86a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"方渠縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"方渠县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bc8d90f5-db0e-11ef-a532-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈州","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"bc8d90f6-db0e-11ef-89d7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"青剛嶺在慶州方渠縣北，靈州之南。","note_content_jianti_auto":"青刚岭在庆州方渠县北，灵州之南。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"bc8d90f2-db0e-11ef-ae00-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"bc8d9102-db0e-11ef-9abf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、庆阳府（卷五十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又后唐天成四年，朔方节度使唐福赴镇，至方渠。羌戎出兵邀福...","context_before":"青冈峡[在县北。亦曰青冈岭。","source_end_index":46,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8665eda1-c371-5a05-83cc-920f2c08c626","source_start_index":14,"source_text":"唐开元四年，单于副都护张知运，击突厥叛户于青冈岭，兵败，为所擒。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/六、庆阳府（卷五十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"至德初，同罗突厥诸部作乱，朔方帅郭子仪约回纥兵讨之。回纥...","context_before":"...将士。唐调露初，裴行俭大破突厥余党阿史那泥孰匐于呼延谷。","source_end_index":227,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"872a5ffc-8fa3-5528-be09-7d15d005f6af","source_start_index":196,"source_text":"开元四年，突厥降户畔。郭知运以朔方兵邀击于黑山呼延谷，大破之。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"先是，單于副都護張知運悉收降戶兵仗，令渡河而南，降戶怨怒。御史中丞姜晦爲巡邊使，降戶訴無弓矢，不得射獵，晦悉還之；降戶得之，遂叛。張知運不設備，與之戰於青剛嶺，爲虜所擒，欲送突厥；至綏州境，將軍郭知運以朔方兵邀擊之，大破其衆於黑山呼延谷，虜釋張知運而去。上以張知運喪師，斬之以徇。","content_fanyi":"在此之前，单于副都护张知运把归降胡人的兵器全部收缴，命令他们渡黄河南下，降户因此怨恨愤怒。御史中丞姜晦正担任巡边使，降户向他诉说没有弓箭，无法射猎，姜晦把收缴的兵器全部归还他们；降户得到兵器后，随即反叛。张知运没有防备，与他们在青刚岭交战，被胡人擒获，胡人想把他送往突厥；行至绥州境内，将军郭知运率领朔方兵截击他们，在黑山呼延谷大破其部众，胡人丢下张知运逃走。玄宗因张知运损失惨重，将他斩首示众。","content_jianti_auto":"先是，单于副都护张知运悉收降户兵仗，令渡河而南，降户怨怒。御史中丞姜晦为巡边使，降户诉无弓矢，不得射猎，晦悉还之；降户得之，遂叛。张知运不设备，与之战于青刚岭，为虏所擒，欲送突厥；至绥州境，将军郭知运以朔方兵邀击之，大破其众于黑山呼延谷，虏释张知运而去。上以张知运丧师，斩之以徇。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21180,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百一十一 (唐紀二十七) / 玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝上之中 / 四年 / 第 24 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bc8d90ef-db0e-11ef-9a7e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":716},"tongjian_id":"bc8d90ef-db0e-11ef-9a7e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙珣","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵珣","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cd262c81-db0e-11ef-a301-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"cd262c82-db0e-11ef-a447-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西绥德","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"cd262c83-db0e-11ef-948f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"延州","place_name_jianti_auto":"延州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"cd262c84-db0e-11ef-abc7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西绥德","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"cd262c85-db0e-11ef-8995-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏州","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"cd262c86-db0e-11ef-8787-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙珣聚米圖經：綏州南至延州界三百四十里。宋白曰：綏州北至夏州三百六十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵珣聚米图经：绥州南至延州界三百四十里。宋白曰：绥州北至夏州三百六十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"cd262c80-db0e-11ef-b100-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西绥德","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"cd262c8d-db0e-11ef-b355-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"21夏州牙內指揮使拓跋崇斌謀作亂，綏州刺史李彝俊將助之，事覺；辛未，彝敏棄州，與其弟彝俊等五人奔延州。","content_fanyi":"后晋夏州牙内指挥使拓跋崇斌暗中谋划叛乱，绥州刺史李彝敏准备协助他起事，结果事情败露；八月二十五日辛未，李彝敏抛下绥州，带着弟弟李彝俊等五人一起投奔延州。","content_jianti_auto":"21夏州牙内指挥使拓跋崇斌谋作乱，绥州刺史李彝俊将助之，事觉；辛未，彝敏弃州，与其弟彝俊等五人奔延州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":29645,"number":21,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百八十三 (後晉紀四) / 齊王上 / 天福八年 / 第 41 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"cd262c7f-db0e-11ef-abd4-a0d3651f611f","year_int":943},"tongjian_id":"cd262c7f-db0e-11ef-abd4-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"綏州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"難，乃旦翻。去，已往也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"难，乃旦翻。去，已往也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"cdfca8c3-db0e-11ef-9e60-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"龍龕手鏡：㖡，音夜。毋，讀如謨。","note_content_jianti_auto":"龙龛手镜：㖡，音夜。毋，读如谟。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"cdfca8c4-db0e-11ef-9ef3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"cdfca8c7-db0e-11ef-9708-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以備羌也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以备羌也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"cdfca8c6-db0e-11ef-a860-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"cdfca8c2-db0e-11ef-ae1f-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yè","source_anchor_text":"載前羌族㖡毋殺綏州","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":25,"text":"㖡","tongjian_id":"684ea968-18f8-54ed-8d0b-01cf52d9c441"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西绥德","resolved_place_entity_id":2176,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"cdfca8cd-db0e-11ef-ade3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"8定難節度使李彝殷發兵屯境上，奏稱：「去三載前羌族㖡毋殺綏州刺史李仁裕叛去，請討之。」慶州上言：「請益兵爲備。」詔以司天言，今歲不利先舉兵，諭止之。","content_fanyi":"定难节度使李彝殷调派军队屯驻边境，并上表朝廷说：“三年之前，羌族㖡毋杀害绥州刺史李仁裕，背叛朝廷后逃走，请求准许出兵讨伐他。”庆州方面上奏说：“请求增加兵力以作防备。”后汉隐帝下诏，以司天官员奏称今年不利于先发兵为由，劝谕李彝殷等停止行动。","content_jianti_auto":"8定难节度使李彝殷发兵屯境上，奏称：「去三载前羌族㖡毋杀绥州刺史李仁裕叛去，请讨之。」庆州上言：「请益兵为备。」诏以司天言，今岁不利先举兵，谕止之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":30174,"number":8,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百八十八 (後漢紀三) / 高祖睿文聖武昭肅孝皇帝下 / 乾祐元年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"cdfca8c2-db0e-11ef-ae1f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":948},"tongjian_id":"cdfca8c2-db0e-11ef-ae1f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":9},"place_name":"綏州"},"message":"success","success":true}